BTW, @Shawn, try this as a substitute of run():
run_with_progress <- function(.env, until=1000, steps=10) {
  for (i in seq(until/steps, until, until/steps)) {
    run(.env, until=i)
    message(paste0(100*i/until, "%"))
  }
  .env
}

I suppose it’s not difficult to capture that output with Shiny to show a nice progress bar.

