Hi,

You are defining the environment two times. You have
simStore <- simmer()

at the beginning, so instead of

simStore <- simmer("Store") %>%
  add_resource("Cashier", 1) %>%
  add_generator("Store Clients", trajClient,  function() {rexp(1, 120

)}) %>%
  run(until=nHoursObserved <- 1) ; simStore

this should work:
simStore %>%
  add_resource("Cashier", 1) %>%
  add_generator("Store Clients", trajClient,  function() {rexp(1, 120)}) %>%
  run(until=nHoursObserved <- 1)

